  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AT2030: A Market Shaping Approach to Activate Public Procurement of Assistive Technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHAI seeks to work with government partners to activate public procurement for AT, while exploring market-shaping approaches for ensuring quality and affordable AT. Over the next 10 months, the 2 proposed programs will strengthen systems while generating new learning and knowledge about how we can advance public AT procurement and market shaping.</narrative>
  </description>
